  "const textures={logo:labelTexture('flo.', '#8e9786','700 100px Arial'),rear:labelTexture('F L O  /  M E M O R Y  D O C K','#97a48c','500 28px Arial'),chip:labelTexture('ESP32-S3','#c0c8bc','500 46px Arial'),battery:labelTexture('RECHARGEABLE  /  CONCEPT','#9aa096','500 24px Arial')};",
